      "widgets_values": [
        "## Fibo 2 Create \u2014 Dev\n\n1. Describe the image you want to create.\n2. Click Run. No input image is required.\n\nDefaults: **1024 \u00d7 1024**, **50 steps**, **CFG 5**, Euler / simple. Dev is the supported Fibo 2 text-to-image model. Keep output near one megapixel; dimensions use multiples of 16.\n\nThe prompt accepts plain text or a structured VGL caption. The advanced negative prompt uses Bria's published text-to-image negative. This workflow does not install or call a prompt enhancer or an external API.\n\nRequires the additional **Fibo 2 Dev INT8** checkpoint (8.41 GB). It reuses the existing Qwen3-VL 4B encoder and FLUX.2 VAE.\n\nFibo model weights \u00a9 BRIA AI, **CC BY-NC 4.0**. Commercial use requires a separate Bria agreement. Qwen encoder and FLUX.2 VAE retain their component licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.\n\nDerived from Comfy Org's MIT-licensed Fibo 2 Dev template."
      ]
    }
